      "title": "tls: Update DTLS 1.2 Connection ID extension",
      "message": "tls: Update DTLS 1.2 Connection ID extension\n\nUpdate DTLS 1.2 Connection ID extension support to final version.\nKeep backward compability with the deprecated extention type (53)\nfrom draft-ietf-tls-dtls-connection-id-07.\n\nCloses #17695\n",
      "author_name": "Stig Bjørlykke",
      "author_email": "stig@bjorlykke.org",
